### Inventory timer after 5s; replenishment after 60s
POST {{application}}/ingress/order-received
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "e9c65030-f65b-4691-9822-a554629cdd4f",
  "shipmentAddress": {
    "streetLine": "Main 1",
    "zipCode": "12345",
    "city": "Berlin",
    "country": "DE"
  },
  "invoiceAddress": {
    "streetLine": "Main 1",
    "zipCode": "12345",
    "city": "Berlin",
    "country": "DE"
  },
  "orderPositions": [
    {
      "name": "out-of-stock",
      "amount": 2,
      "price": 10.00
    }
  ]
}

### Find the correct orderId and activity type, then set taskId above
GET {{application}}/user-tasks

### Failed payment detail and confirmation
GET {{application}}/failed-payment/{{taskId}}

###
POST {{application}}/failed-payment/{{taskId}}

### Inventory delay detail and confirmation
GET {{application}}/delayed-inventory/{{taskId}}

###
POST {{application}}/delayed-inventory/{{taskId}}

### Optional manual redeployment (startup already deploys this shared resource)
POST {{application}}/deploy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "path": "C8/Order Fulfillment.bpmn"
}
